   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 3,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:13",
   "text": "One shared garment type, and it's the disqualifying one. Logged.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 4,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:14",
   "text": "Same trip: The garment type here is the one I reach for constantly.",
   "images": [
    "blue/solid_mini_skirt.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 5,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:15",
   "text": "So that garment type is your default. Logged.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 6,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:16",
   "text": "Also in the bag: Every one of these two is a different piece, and they share a single color. That color is the reason none of them worked.",
