   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:15",
   "text": "Clean comparison. The first one's pattern is banned.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 14,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:16",
   "text": "Same sort: If I had to name one pattern I always go for, it's the pattern here.",
